 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t a single objectively “best” roofer for every Dallas home. **DAR Roofing General Contractors** looks like a reasonable company to include on your shortlist: the available BBB results show an A+ rating and a 4.96/5 average from 24 customer reviews. That’s a useful signal, but not a guarantee of workmanship or the best fit for your project.\n\nBefore choosing, get **at least three written, itemized bids** and compare the exact materials, tear-off and disposal, ventilation and flashing work, cleanup, workmanship warranty, and manufacturer warranty. Verify the contractor’s insurance, ask for recent local replacement references, and don’t sign based on a storm-damage or insurance-claim promise alone.",
